From 5bfa29e5f4e6fcc4f91bf792f85bb46f782f2130 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrien MOYAUX <49562406+adrienm7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 14:06:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(macos): host the layout manager window in
 ui/layout_manager

The Windows and Linux hosts of the shared layout manager page live in
ui/layout_manager, the page's own name, while the macOS host sat under
ui/menu. The driver tree parity ratchet therefore saw a folder present on
two drivers only and a union of driver directories that grew with no
shared counterpart. One folder on every driver is also where the next
reader looks for the host. The ratchet records the new shared folder and
drops the slack it had carried (30 of 52 shared).
---
 ..._layout_manager.lua => test_layout_manager_window.lua} | 6 +++---
 .../menu_layout_manager.lua => layout_manager/init.lua}   | 8 ++++----
 tools/test/test-driver-tree-parity.cjs                    | 7 +++++--
 tools/test/test-webview-geometry-single-source.cjs        | 2 +-
 4 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)
 rename static/ergopti_plus/macos/tests/unit/ui/{menu/test_menu_layout_manager.lua => test_layout_manager_window.lua} (91%)
 rename static/ergopti_plus/macos/ui/{menu/menu_layout_manager.lua => layout_manager/init.lua} (97%)

